/-!
# A059365

Another version of the Catalan triangle: T(r,s) = binomial(2*r-s-1,r-1) - binomial(2*r-s-1,r), r>=0, 0 <= s <= r.

The 64 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

